{"availability":"available","full":"eizport/exporter-importer-z","name":"exporter-importer-z","description":"Move WordPress content with its media, settings and files: .wxrz bundles for the WordPress Importer, Playground zips, and abilities for AI agents.","category":"Business","language":"PHP","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T11:58:48Z","updated":"2026-10-11T03:38:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://eizport.github.io/","topics":["abilities-api","mcp","migration","woocommerce","wordpress","wordpress-export","wordpress-import","wordpress-playground","wordpress-plugin","wxr"],"demo":"https://wordpress.org/playground/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:44.471Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:44.471Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:44.471Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:44.471Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Contributors: eizport, camaleaun Donate link: Tags: export, import, wxr, migration, media Requires at least: 7.0 Tested up to: 7.1 Requires PHP: 7.4 Stable tag: 0.10.0 License: GPLv2 or later License URI:","Export content with its media files in one .wxrz bundle and import it with the WordPress Importer, without downloading the media again.","Exporter Importer Z gives Tools → Export a new screen, built like WordPress's newest admin screens, and extends the WordPress Importer. The classic Export screen, with the same choices added, stays one setting away."],"features":["One list: the content types, Attachments and Options. Check what to export; nothing checked exports all content.","Items in a side panel: each type's items with search, filters and a checkbox per item — by filters or by selection. Items show their roles (Homepage, Posts page, Shop page…).","Options: one by one, by group (Basics suggested) or all of them. Settings that point to the items exported (homepage, posts page, privacy policy page, site icon, WooCommerce pages) come alon